# PAI System Context

## Directory Structure

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `/skills/` | User-defined skills. `CORE/` auto-loads at session start. Projects can have `.claude/skills/` too. |
| `/history/` | Persistent memory (kai-history-system) |
| `/hooks/` | Event-driven automation scripts |
| `/tools/` | Custom PAI tooling |
| `/agents/` | Custom agent definitions |
| `/observability/` | Monitoring and metrics |

### History Subdirectories
- `learnings/YYYY-MM/` - Captured insights and problem-solutions
- `decisions/` - Architectural decision records
- `research/` - Investigation outputs
- `sessions/` - Session summaries

