## PAI Tools

**PREFER these deterministic tools over AI-generated solutions to save tokens:**

### SkillSearch
Search for skills across all levels (project → user). Project skills override user skills.

```bash
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/SkillSearch.ts "<query>"      # Search by keywords
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/SkillSearch.ts --list         # List all skills
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/SkillSearch.ts --user-only "<query>"  # Skip project skills
```

**Scoring:** +10 name match, +5 trigger match, +2 description match

**Multi-level:** Automatically discovers skills from CWD up to ~/.claude. Project-level skills take priority.

**Use when:** Finding skills for a task, checking available capabilities

### GenerateSkillIndex
Generate skill-index.json at each level from CWD to ~/.claude.

```bash
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/GenerateSkillIndex.ts              # Auto-detect all levels
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/GenerateSkillIndex.ts --path /dir  # Single directory
```

**Auto-detect mode:** Walks up from CWD, generates index at each .claude/skills/ with SKILL.md files.

**Use when:** After creating/modifying/deleting skills at any level

### MergeSkillIndexes
Merge skill indexes from all levels into single output (runtime only, stdout).

```bash
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/MergeSkillIndexes.ts              # Merge from CWD
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/MergeSkillIndexes.ts --from /path # Start from specific dir
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/MergeSkillIndexes.ts --list       # List index locations
```

**Priority:** Project-level skills override user-level skills of same name.

**Use when:** Programmatically getting merged skill data (SkillSearch uses this internally)

### PaiArchitecture
Generate architecture documentation and check system health.

```bash
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PaiArchitecture.ts generate       # Generate Architecture.md
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PaiArchitecture.ts status         # Show current state (stdout)
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PaiArchitecture.ts check          # Verify installation health
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PaiArchitecture.ts log-upgrade "description" [type]
```

**Types:** pack, config, bundle, plugin

**Use when:** Updating architecture docs, checking PAI health, logging upgrades

### PackageSkill
Package skills into .skill format (ZIP) for export to Claude.ai.

```bash
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts <skill-name>              # Package single skill
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts <skill-name> --output ./  # Custom output dir
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts --all                     # Package all skills
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts --list                    # List available skills
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts --validate <skill-name>   # Validate only
bun run $PAI_DIR/Tools/PackageSkill.ts --validate-size <skill-name>  # Check size only
```

**Features:**
- Converts PascalCase to kebab-case (Agent Skills spec)
- Maps directories: Tools → scripts, Workflows → references, Templates → assets
- Validates frontmatter, path references, and size limits (30MB max)
- Supports `.skillignore` for excluding files (gitignore syntax)

**Default output:** `~/.claude/exports/`

**Use when:** Exporting skills for Claude.ai, validating skill structure

